3. Bundled INT8 calibration images
----------------------------------
    assets/calib/*.jpg  (24 images)
    COCO val2017 image ids:
      33368, 62554, 66635, 76416, 77460, 78266, 79651, 94871, 100238,
      111207, 119233, 127182, 160012, 172877, 192670, 213547, 306893,
      309655, 315492, 366884, 369751, 377882, 416885, 577932
    All 24 are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 2.0 Generic (CC BY 2.0)
    http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/
    Per-image source URLs and licence records: assets/calib/MANIFEST.json

These define the activation ranges for the INT8 model that models/quantize.py
builds, which is the default model this project runs. They are committed so a
clean clone can build that model offline and reproducibly.

Selection is reproducible via scripts/build_calibration_set.py and was
constrained to images whose COCO licence field is 4, 7 or 8 -- the only ones
that may be redistributed here. They are also drawn from *outside* the first
300 val2017 images, which are the evaluation subset, so the quantised model is
never calibrated on data it is later scored against.


